{"id":"a2a6dd6075aba07c","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-traceability.md","title":"可计算 trace 与 c.e. trace","display":"df-traceability — 可计算 trace 与 c.e. trace","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-traceability","aliases":["20-df-traceability"],"display":"df-traceability — 可计算 trace 与 c.e. trace","chapter":"11","section":"11.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 11.4.1","source_pdf_pages":[223,224],"source_printed_pages":[192,193],"depends_on":["[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-relative-ce]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-traceability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-traceability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-traceability — 可计算 trace 与 c.e. trace"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 11.4.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>223</span><span>224</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>192</span><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(X\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；所有被追踪函数均全定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}traceability}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{CompTraceable}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^X)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[|D_{h(n)}|\\le p(n)\\land f(n)\\in D_{h(n)}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CETraceable}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^X)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[|W_{h(n)}|\\le p(n)\\land f(n)\\in W_{h(n)}].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}traceability}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{CompTraceable}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^X)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[|D_{h(n)}|\\le p(n)\\land f(n)\\in D_{h(n)}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CETraceable}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^X)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[|W_{h(n)}|\\le p(n)\\land f(n)\\in W_{h(n)}].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一个大小界 p 适用于全部 X 可计算函数，但 trace 索引 h 可以随 f 改变。把量词次序颠倒会得到不同且过强的条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.4.1；印刷页 192, 193；PDF 第 223, 224 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}traceability}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{CompTraceable}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^X)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[|D_{h(n)}|\\le p(n)\\land f(n)\\in D_{h(n)}],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CETraceable}(X)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^X)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\exists h\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall n\\\n[|W_{h(n)}|\\le p(n)\\land f(n)\\in W_{h(n)}].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1744,"backlinks":[{"id":"54a71b43597f2750","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-traceability]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-344","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-traceability]] — 章 11；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-344","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-traceability]]"}],"outgoing":["59004ac6d23e86f8","2c15e9656c322806","e343870c773cb68e"]}